  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/519b73606071e3c7771ae34dab8a918fc6444c4f.png\" alt=\"模組標題\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/39081201c6636a5ef47c00d273a1a61223f8721d_0.webp\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emerald-armorr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5a1f08f989f139d720f80eec4152aa0c55a8d7b2.png\" alt=\"可在CurseForge取得\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femerald-armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/50f2eaa6263492cc65f49ef84a31e7d9fb51179c.png\" alt=\"可在Modrith取得\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e5543028679ad68fb79cd2cc39d5f22bfad46cb2.png\" alt=\"適用於Forge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0c451a4c61b3de18ebc59ae657713e82cf890293.png\" alt=\"適用於NeoForge\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/39081201c6636a5ef47c00d273a1a61223f8721d_0.webp\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h1>📜・模組介紹</h1><p>綠寶石套裝模組是一個為Minecraft添加綠寶石工具與盔甲的模組，其與其他模組最大的不同在於採用原版風格設計，因此沒有任何改動內容——僅提供基礎工具（不含特殊能力的鎬、斧等），綠寶石盔甲與工具的性能略優於鑽石材質。</p><p>為什麼你應該選擇我們的模組而非其他綠寶石模組？</p><p>本模組堅持原版風格，安裝後能讓你保有遊玩Minecraft的純粹體驗，而非像在玩另一款遊戲。如果你熱愛原版感受，絕對值得一試。</p><p>此模組可安裝於伺服器端，但若想單人遊玩，客戶端也需安裝模組。</p><p>本模組使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCreator</a> 製作</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/39081201c6636a5ef47c00d273a1a61223f8721d_0.webp\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h1>🍽️・合成方式</h1><ul>\n<li>盔甲合成：</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab443b815f57859e1028cd2a920ede9ecd55d408.png\" alt=\"1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f28bc404953d1969a658ca8901fff6e36fc6e470.png\" alt=\"2\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c98c5fbb97af2f2778bca42a573437b65ccee8a2.png\" alt=\"3\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f99334a7bc787b00ec204c06ca003a737086aa5a.png\" alt=\"4\"></p><ul>\n<li>工具合成：</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/de0d3b7321d79fde54234444d665b0e52b3fdfdb.png\" alt=\"5\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8b385cab13d1f50f418667128f85f5a7e4c44a04.png\" alt=\"6\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6317edca65eb287b3c8e9f2929bf7f39f4da1cbf.png\" alt=\"7\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f3cca209b60fa335e76e49af7957b3f132fd5c16.png\" alt=\"8\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/130bd39ebb66606eba071c9d38802afb63eab696.png\" alt=\"9\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/39081201c6636a5ef47c00d273a1a61223f8721d_0.webp\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252fsurvivalcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e0331077d460e51697846547d2413dfa3bd9b0ba_0.webp\" alt=\"模組標題\">\n</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcomplete-turtle-armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eccbbb2ca1468ab9f7158b493e07924db3a68015.png\" alt=\"模組標題\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcraft-chain-armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/772cb26fec5d218e0f7d95eed6b376ac1fbcb53f_0.webp\" alt=\"模組標題\"></a></p>",
